  "honesty_note_lv": "PROPOSED mācību politikas priekšlikums: 2025. gada oficiālā programma (RSU_MedChem_Colloq1_Prog_LV_2025.pdf) nenosaka prakses ceļu garumus, uzdevumu pasniegšanas secību vai iztrūkuma noteikumus (oficiāls analogs: UNDETERMINED). Deklarētais garums ir mērķis, nevis solījums; nerecenzēti uzdevumi nekad netiek iekļauti.",
  "honesty_note_en": "PROPOSED training policy: the 2025 programme sets no bounded practice lengths, ordering rule, or shortage handling. Declared lengths are targets grounded in N20 bank counts; unreviewed content is never drawn.",
  "predecessor_decisions": [
    {
      "card_id": "F03",
      "ref": "MASTER_WORKSPACE_AUDIT_AND_35_TASK_ROADMAP.md#F03",
      "decision": "Per-topic bounded practice: a short, ordered path rather than an endless random question stream."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "F08",
      "ref": "MASTER_WORKSPACE_AUDIT_AND_35_TASK_ROADMAP.md#F08",
      "decision": "Adaptive difficulty remains DEFERRED and out of scope for N30."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "N20-Bank",
      "ref": "evidence/N20_VERIFICATION_RECORD.json#frozen_bank",
      "decision": "112 reviewed bank instances across 28 families (4 families x 4 variants = 16 eligible instances per topic) plus N20 ephemeral variant instantiation."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "N21-ModeRegistry",
      "ref": "data/exam_policy.json#view_discipline",
      "decision": "Practice mode enables hint, chain, method-card, and term-lookup components while exam mode forbids them."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "N24-Eligibility",
      "ref": "docs/FORM_ASSEMBLY_FORMAT.md",
      "decision": "Absolute review-eligibility gate: review.{accessibility,calculation,content,source} === 'passed' and review_workflow.state === 'accepted'."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "N26-N27-N28-N29",
      "ref": "docs/SCHEDULER_FORMAT.md",
      "decision": "One pure path engine serves topic browse, N27/N29 scheduler/revision queue handoffs (N27-to-N30-practice-entry), and N28 remediation retries (N28-to-N30-remediation-retry)."
    }
  ],
